      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagramme de classes UML du profil Security. Vulnerability (publishedTime, modifiedTime, withdrawnTime) spécialise Core/Artifact. La classe abstraite VulnAssessmentRelationship spécialise Core/Relationship, restreint « to » à exactement un Element et ajoute assessedElement, suppliedBy et les trois dates ; elle est spécialisée par CvssV2/V3/V4VulnAssessmentRelationship (score, severity, vectorString), EpssVulnAssessmentRelationship (probability, percentile), ExploitCatalogVulnAssessmentRelationship (catalogType, exploited, locator), SsvcVulnAssessmentRelationship (decisionType) et la classe abstraite VexVulnAssessmentRelationship (vexVersion, statusNotes). La classe VEX a quatre sous-classes : VexAffected (actionStatement[1], actionStatementTime), VexFixed, VexNotAffected (justificationType, impactStatement, impactStatementTime) et VexUnderInvestigation. Énumérations : CvssSeverityType, ExploitCatalogType, SsvcDecisionType, VexJustificationType.",
